    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/8cb96fd97eeab82208292dcdbd292c72.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One man. One day. One massive mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Billy just wanted to throw a fun birthday party for his son.</i><br>Too bad he invited the entire town\u2026 to the petting zoo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now there\u2019s poop everywhere \u2014 and his boss returns Sunday at 19:00 sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/c2c00025445c529d3c4cd3e81d130226.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet Shit Billy</strong> is a lovingly-crafted parody of 1980s multi-screen platformers. Explore dozens of interconnected rooms filled with bizarre humor, pun-filled names, and hidden surprises. Dodge flying animals, angry janitors, and unflushable disasters as you try to clean the entire zoo before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/e90d2fc7e450e1a70be4a4cb947974c7.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfc <strong>86 rooms</strong> of cleanup chaos in classic pixel-art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Absurd humor</strong> and surprise-filled room names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca9 <strong>No violence</strong> \u2013 just messes to clean and mayhem to dodge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Retro-inspired sound effects and music</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Explore, experiment, and survive</strong> through trial-and-error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Keyboard-only controls</strong> for a true old-school feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 <strong>Time-based challenge</strong> \u2013 finish before the boss gets back!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/fc6ecc68ee1ce39f3df0a705b4f556a3.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/8cb96fd97eeab82208292dcdbd292c72.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One man. One day. One massive mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Billy just wanted to throw a fun birthday party for his son.</i><br>Too bad he invited the entire town\u2026 to the petting zoo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now there\u2019s poop everywhere \u2014 and his boss returns Sunday at 19:00 sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/c2c00025445c529d3c4cd3e81d130226.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet Shit Billy</strong> is a lovingly-crafted parody of 1980s multi-screen platformers. Explore dozens of interconnected rooms filled with bizarre humor, pun-filled names, and hidden surprises. Dodge flying animals, angry janitors, and unflushable disasters as you try to clean the entire zoo before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/e90d2fc7e450e1a70be4a4cb947974c7.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfc <strong>86 rooms</strong> of cleanup chaos in classic pixel-art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Absurd humor</strong> and surprise-filled room names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca9 <strong>No violence</strong> \u2013 just messes to clean and mayhem to dodge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Retro-inspired sound effects and music</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Explore, experiment, and survive</strong> through trial-and-error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Keyboard-only controls</strong> for a true old-school feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 <strong>Time-based challenge</strong> \u2013 finish before the boss gets back!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826140/extras/fc6ecc68ee1ce39f3df0a705b4f556a3.avif?t=1751822258\" width=480 height=300 /></span></p>",
